If you abandon Lala-chan, who's trapped inside the castle, and become my boyfriend,

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:39.270
I'll allow everyone to return to your original world.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.190
What did you say?!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:44.490
Well then, scripted event commence!

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.770
What was that loud noise?

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:49.200
Are you all right, Yuuki-kun?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.860
Hi! Nice to meet you!

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:53.160
Eh?! Magical Kyouko-chan?

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:55.410
Looks like everyone is here.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:59.740
What is that Great Demon Lord{Queen} doing?

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:03.380
Maybe the customizer program had some problems

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:05.220
Ow...{remove if you want}

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:06.670
What happened?

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:09.320
The scripted event has already started!

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:12.010
Let's warp everyone to the Great Demon Lord's{Queen's} castle!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.170
Go!

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:27.010
Ow ow ow...{remove if you want}

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:33.340
Why do you always do this?!

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:34.700
Hey, this place is...

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:39.330
Yeah, the Great Demon Lord{Queen}'s castle she just mentioned.

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:42.450
Lala is inside. Let's go.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:43.500
Yeah.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.800
Undead monsters appear

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:55.050
Wait, how can such strong monsters suddenly appear?!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.510
We haven't even leveled up much!

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.600
I-It's impossible for us to win.

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:13.480
It's no big deal, is it?

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.870
Enemy defeated

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.440
We've been saved.

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.370
Yami-san!

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:24.650
Why are you a bunny girl?

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:28.090
Yami: Playgirl

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.080
I turned into this after going to the transfer room.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:35.060
It's great that you're here to help us, thank you!

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:35.640
It's nothing.

00:16:38.270 --> 00:16:39.390
Stop right there!

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.520
Tenjouin-senpai? Even Run is here?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:49.020
 Enemy appears

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.850
It's a twist of fate that allowed us to meet here.

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:49.020
Before the destiny queen, Tenjouin Saki, don't you dare take any step forward.

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:51.550
I'm sorry, but please know your place.

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:56.870
Rito-kun, I said I didn't want to do this, but Tenjouin-senpai threatened me...

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.890
Aya, use your magic to make the first strike.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:02.890
Yes. Er... will this work?

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:03.830
Iva Pupurin!

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:10.920
Oh my!

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:13.920
What kind of curse is this?

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.300
Let's ignore them and move on.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.960
Lala!

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:28.130
Lala...

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:30.480
Welcome, Rito-kun.

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.630
Have you decided on an answer?

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.100
That's...

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:41.490
To fight against the unbeatable Great Demon Lord{Queen}, or become my boyfriend to save everyone?

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:44.410
So, which do you choose?

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.800
Me? Or is it Lala-chan?

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:53.920
You don't mean to say there's someone else in your heart besides Lala-chan, right?

00:17:56.150 --> 00:18:00.750
I... How do I really feel..

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:02.810
I...

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.830
I...

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:13.830
Is it okay for me to always... stay like this?

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:17.990
Ah, seriously, you're such a dummy!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:21.050
Do you like Lala-chan? How do you feel?

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:22.700
You're really indecisive!

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:24.870
I...

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:29.540
Yuuki-kun.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.800
Hmm... Rito?

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.550
I... may be...

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:45.390
...in love with Lala-chan..

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:53.300
But I'm still not sure... if this feeling...

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:55.290
could be called love.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.300
That's why....

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:58.030
It's all right, Rito.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.650
You don't have to say any more.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:04.800
I love you.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:06.660
These feelings will never change.

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:11.630
I'm happy enough to have heard your true feelings for me.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.670
Lala...

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:21.370
It sounds so superficial!

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:23.720
Forget it, I'm tired of this.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:29.210
If you get a game over, you'll have to start from the beginning again, please!

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:35.570
Oh dear, what a useless Great Demon Lord{Queen}, isn't she?

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:38.280
Looks like this bug is pretty bad, isn't it.{bug/virus}

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:42.410
It will be fine as long as we defeat the Great Demon Lord{Queen} and beat the game.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.410
Yami-san?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.450
It's useless!

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:51.210
Yami-san's attack didn't work.

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:53.580
Why are you being so despicable?!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.830
Put out the flames right now!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:58.110
What do you mean by despicable? I <i>am</i> the final boss you know.

00:19:58.110 --> 00:19:59.960
It's all right, Sis.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:00.840
That voice...

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:04.180
Rito-san, please raise up your watering can.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.350
Come on, hurry up!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:06.900
Eh? Watering can?

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.570
Raise it up?

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.020
 Golden watering can -- Lightning Shower!

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:19.030
The Florist's Watering Can extinguishes the Great Demon Lord{Queen}'s flames.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:21.940
This is an ancient power which purifies the entire world.

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:25.270
Oh no!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.030
 The Great Demon Lord is finally defeated!

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.740
We did it!

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:32.530
It's been a long time since we last met, Sis.

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:34.370
Everyone, nice to meet you.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:35.460
Who are you?

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:38.170
Nana! Momo!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.460
It's been a while, Onee-sama.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.530
Onee-sama?

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:45.290
They are my younger twin sisters.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.310
Yours?

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:48.220
So you had sisters?

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:51.230
You two are the ones who made this world, right?!

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:52.480
Why did you do such a thing?

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:56.370
We want to know about this race, the earthlings.

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:57.670
As well as that guy.

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.390
Eh, me?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.940
We can only determine a person's true nature under such circumstances.

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:08.890
Thanks to that, we now know that Onee-sama has many fantastic friends.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:11.200
I don't really want to admit it...

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.560
But his face looks like a beast.

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.620
Beast...

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:20.670
I'm really sorry to have caused everyone so much trouble.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:22.090
Nothing like that.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:26.030
That's right. Besides, it was really fun, right?

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:27.090
I guess so.

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:30.160
Thank you, everyone.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:33.980
All right, it's about time we send everyone back to their original world.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.940
Nana, where's the remote control?

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:39.120
About that... I seem to have lost it.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:40.880
Does that mean...

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:42.920
We can't go back?

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:44.110
What's happening?

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:44.110
What?

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:51.490
The world is collapsing...

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:54.000
If this carries on, we will all disappear too!

00:22:05.680 --> 00:22:06.700
What is that?!

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:07.840
She's huge!

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:11.720
The remote control is over here, but I'm not going to return it.

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:14.970
What? Since when?

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:17.730
Because we forced a change, the bug got even worse!

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:21.580
Everyone should vanish!

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:26.250
Lala! Your clothes!

00:22:26.250 --> 00:22:29.860
Oh, these clothes are also part of the data.

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:35.270
What's going on?!

00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:37.620
You musn't look, Yuuki-kun.

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:39.190
I'm not looking!

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:44.090
I'm sorry.

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:46.300
He saw them again...

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:52.760
Oh my.

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:54.930
What?{Huh?}

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:56.430
No!

00:22:59.720 --> 00:23:01.970
<i>No!</i>

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:03.900
Everyone, vanish!

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:11.950
If this persists, we will all be trapped in this world.

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:14.330
Don't worry, we only have to defeat that bitch.

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:17.450
 Nana Asta Deviluke: Summoner

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:17.450
 Momo Belia Deviluke: Summoner

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:17.450
We made preparations to fight the bug if something like this happened.

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:18.370
Here I go!

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.080
Summon!

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.380
What, Maro?!

00:23:34.380 --> 00:23:38.890
Master, I've come to save you. Leave this to me.

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:40.190
It's talking.

00:23:40.180 --> 00:23:41.440
And it's so huge!

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:43.970
Here I go!

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:46.950
Summon!

00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:51.010
There!

00:23:58.550 --> 00:23:59.580
Celine!

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:01.960
Attack!{Go!}

00:24:11.140 --> 00:24:14.800
Magical Kyouko, whatever the problem is... burn it to solve it!

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:17.520
Go, Kyouko-chan!

00:24:18.500 --> 00:24:24.500
We defeated the Great Demon Lord{Queen} Kyouko-chan, and returned to our original world.

00:24:25.140 --> 00:24:26.230
But...

00:24:26.230 --> 00:24:27.790
That's right, go!{That's it!}

00:24:27.790 --> 00:24:30.440
What are they doing here?...

